<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<!DOCTYPE plist PUBLIC "-//Apple//DTD PLIST 1.0//EN" "http://www.apple.com/DTDs/PropertyList-1.0.dtd">
<plist version="1.0">
<dict>
	<key>PayloadType</key>
	<string>Configuration</string>
	<key>PayloadVersion</key>
	<integer>1</integer>
	<key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
	<string>io.github.studyreadbook4ever.howToSafeDNS</string>
	<key>PayloadUUID</key>
	<string>984B3F37-3B34-5CE9-BA37-078DC5D9C521</string>
	<key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
	<string>howToSafeDNS · Control D · DoH</string>
	<key>PayloadDescription</key>
	<string>This file contains a single DNS configuration only. It does not include a root certificate, VPN, device management enrollment or app installation. You can inspect the XML source on GitHub.

The profile is unsigned. “Unsigned” means it has no distributor signature; this is separate from the DNS connection's TLS encryption. Check the name and DNS addresses on the installation screen before deciding to install.

A free malicious-domain filter. The IP addresses below are for encrypted connections and differ from its plaintext DNS addresses. Legitimate domains may also be blocked incorrectly.

Control D's free DNS documentation states that it does not store individual browsing histories, timestamps or query logs. Paid accounts and the website have separate privacy policies.

Privacy policy: https://controld.com/privacy</string>
	<key>PayloadScope</key>
	<string>System</string>
	<key>PayloadContent</key>
	<array>
		<dict>
			<key>PayloadType</key>
			<string>com.apple.dnsSettings.managed</string>
			<key>PayloadVersion</key>
			<integer>1</integer>
			<key>PayloadIdentifier</key>
			<string>io.github.studyreadbook4ever.howToSafeDNS.dns</string>
			<key>PayloadUUID</key>
			<string>E161CE5F-0E04-570C-A4AA-BD4756A9EBF5</string>
			<key>PayloadDisplayName</key>
			<string>howToSafeDNS · Control D · DoH</string>
			<key>DNSSettings</key>
			<dict>
				<key>DNSProtocol</key>
				<string>HTTPS</string>
				<key>ServerAddresses</key>
				<array>
					<string>76.76.2.11</string>
					<string>76.76.10.11</string>
					<string>2606:1a40::11</string>
					<string>2606:1a40:1::11</string>
				</array>
				<key>ServerURL</key>
				<string>https://freedns.controld.com/p1</string>
			</dict>
		</dict>
	</array>
</dict>
</plist>
